  "an5.219:1.1": "pañcime bhikkhave ādīnavā aggismiṃ ",
  "an5.219:1.2": "katame pañca ",
  "an5.219:1.3": "acakkhusso dubbaṇṇakaraṇo dubbalakaraṇo saṅgaṇikāpavaḍḍhano tiracchānakathāpavattaniko ",
  "an5.219:1.4": "ime kho bhikkhave pañca ādīnavā aggisminti. ",
